    "name": "CapEx change request",
    "description": "A change request on an approved project: logged, approved at once within 10% of the approved amount, otherwise re-approved by the finance controller, the CFO and (revised total over $250,000) the CEO. Approval raises the approved amount and commits the extra budget.",
